# Watch a live value
@scenario office_lesson_21
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk notes]
pip: The engineer wants the office dashboard to follow a variable. Open the supplied facet and find the binding.
pip: Open config/facets/tutorial_card.facet. Change the visible caption and preview it with its bound state.
> Open the office checklist -> checklist
> Try the checkpoint -> check
@label checklist
[set desk_name Pip]
[set desk_readiness 0.75]
[screen call tutorial_card]
@label check
pip: What should drive a reactive dashboard?
> The state value that changes. -> correct
> A copied screenshot of the readout. -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: A binding reads the current value whenever the UI updates. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: A binding reads the current value whenever the UI updates.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_21]
[flag tutorial_done_21]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_5]
